  "details": "Currently the SDK display errors like: \"Avatar exceeds the maximum limit 256 of this component type.  Reduce the number of VRCPhysBone components on this avatar.\" before the avatar is build, with tools like Modual Avatar, vrcfury etc doing this check before a build is just incorrect.\n\nMy avatar for example before build reports 255 VRCPhysBones, but after a build its just 23 or similar depending which variant of the avatar I will build.\n\nAny checks like that should be just a warning, and only cause a fail if conditions are not met at the end of the build.",
